<%# locals: (point:, site:) -%>
<%# ondaC2 (C10): câmera na página do ponto — ao vivo com falar (áudio de duas vias), PTZ, gravar agora, gravações e ajustes. %>
<% cmds = Points::Command.commands_for(point) %>
<% rec = Recordings.settings(point) %>
<% can_cmd = point.writable && can?(:command, risk: point.risk) %>
<section class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3 mt-4" aria-labelledby="cam-title">
  <div class="ss-card ss-card-pad lg:col-span-2" data-app="skip">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3">
      <h2 id="cam-title" class="flex-1 min-w-0"><%= t("cameras.title") %></h2>
    </div>
    <%# Tile de câmera da gem; o controller camera (quadro, WebRTC e falar) troca o data-state. O selo diz se grava. %>
    <%= render Ss::CameraTileComponent.new(title: point.name, state: :loading, age: 0, retry_button: true, status: (t("cameras.modes.#{rec['mode']}") unless rec["mode"] == "off"),
                                           data: { controller: "camera", camera_snapshot_value: camera_snapshot_path(point), camera_webrtc_value: camera_webrtc_path(point),
                                                   camera_interval_value: 5, camera_mic_denied_value: t("cameras.mic_denied") }) do |c| %>
      <% c.with_frame do %>
        <img data-camera-target="img" alt="<%= t("dashboards.w.image_x", name: point.name) %>" hidden>
        <video data-camera-target="video" playsinline autoplay hidden aria-label="<%= t("dashboards.w.live_x", name: point.name) %>"></video>
      <% end %>
      <% c.with_action do %>
        <button type="button" data-camera-target="liveButton" data-action="camera#toggle" aria-pressed="false" title="<%= t("dashboards.w.live") %>" aria-label="<%= t("dashboards.w.live_x", name: point.name) %>"><%= icon("status-online", "size-4") %></button>
      <% end %>
      <% if cmds.include?("play_media") && can_cmd %>
        <% c.with_action do %>
          <button type="button" data-camera-target="talkButton" data-action="camera#talk" aria-pressed="false" title="<%= t("cameras.talk") %>" aria-label="<%= t("cameras.talk") %>"><%= icon("microphone", "size-4") %></button>
        <% end %>
      <% end %>
    <% end %>
    <%# Aviso do controller camera (microfone negado). %>
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-danger mt-2" data-camera-target="status" role="status" hidden></p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid gap-4 content-start">
    <% if cmds.include?("ptz") && can_cmd %>
      <div class="ss-card ss-card-pad">
        <h3 class="mb-3"><%= t("cameras.ptz") %></h3>
        <%# Ss::DPadComponent sem a linha voltar/início/menu: a cruz move, o meio ("Início") volta à posição inicial e a
            gangorra aproxima/afasta. Cada tecla manda command=ptz com value= o movimento. %>
        <%= render Ss::DPadComponent.new(url: command_point_path(point, command: "ptz"), param: :value, nav_row: false, volume: true,
                                         keys: { ok: "home", volume_up: "zoom_in", volume_down: "zoom_out" },
                                         labels: { remote: t("cameras.ptz"), up: t("cameras.moves.up"), down: t("cameras.moves.down"), left: t("cameras.moves.left"),
                                                   right: t("cameras.moves.right"), ok: t("cameras.moves.home_short"), volume_up: t("cameras.moves.zoom_in"),
                                                   volume_down: t("cameras.moves.zoom_out"), volume: t("cameras.zoom") }, css: "mx-auto") %>
      </div>
    <% end %>

    <div class="ss-card ss-card-pad">
      <h3><%= t("cameras.recordings") %></h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1"><%= t("cameras.mode_now", mode: t("cameras.modes.#{rec['mode']}"), days: rec["retention_days"]) %></p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3">
        <%= link_to site_media_browse_path(site, "recordings", path: point.id), class: "ss-btn ss-btn-ghost ss-btn-sm" do %><%= icon("video-camera", "size-4") %><%= t("cameras.see_recordings") %><% end %>
        <% if cmds.include?("record") && can_cmd %>
          <%= button_to command_point_path(point), params: { command: "record", value: rec["event_s"] }, class: "ss-btn ss-btn-outline ss-btn-sm" do %><%= icon("stop", "size-4") %><%= t("cameras.record_now", s: rec["event_s"]) %><% end %>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <% if can?(:manage) %>
      <details class="ss-card ss-card-pad">
        <summary class="font-bold text-ink cursor-pointer"><%= t("cameras.settings") %></summary>
        <%= form_with url: camera_settings_path(point), method: :patch, class: "grid gap-3 mt-3" do %>
          <div>
            <label class="ss-label" for="rec-mode"><%= t("cameras.mode") %></label>
            <%= select_tag :mode, options_for_select(Recordings::MODES.map { |m| [ t("cameras.modes.#{m}"), m ] }, rec["mode"]), id: "rec-mode", class: "ss-input" %>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <div>
              <label class="ss-label" for="rec-days"><%= t("cameras.retention") %></label>
              <%= number_field_tag :retention_days, rec["retention_days"], id: "rec-days", class: "ss-input num", min: 1, max: Recordings::MAX_RETENTION %>
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="ss-label" for="rec-secs"><%= t("cameras.event_s") %></label>
              <%= number_field_tag :event_s, rec["event_s"], id: "rec-secs", class: "ss-input num", min: 5, max: Points::Command::MAX_RECORD_S %>
            </div>
          </div>
          <label class="ss-check"><%= check_box_tag :ptz, "1", point.address["ptz"] || cmds.include?("ptz"), id: "cam-ptz" %> <%= t("cameras.has_ptz") %></label>
          <label class="ss-check"><%= check_box_tag :talk, "1", point.address["talk"], id: "cam-talk" %> <%= t("cameras.has_talk") %></label>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted"><%= t("cameras.settings_hint") %></p>
          <button class="ss-btn ss-btn-primary"><%= t("cameras.save") %></button>
        <% end %>
      </details>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</section>
